{"about_the_game":"Welcome to 'Bodyguard Task Force,' the VR game that puts you in the shoes of a bodyguard on a mission to ensure the safety of VIPs. Play solo or team up online for cooperative play as you navigate through a variety of missions, each presenting unique challenges. From urban landscapes to potential threats, every bullet counts in this heart-pounding experience. Compete on the leaderboard to showcase your skills and become the ultimate protector.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Play Solo or team up with 3 other friends in multiplayer Coop. <br></li><li>Deploy a variety of weapons and attachments.<br></li><li>Diverse missions set in a range of environments for you to select from.<br></li><li>Unpredictable enemies each playthrough.<br></li><li>Compete to attain the highests ranks on the global leaderboard.</li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Pistolero","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2857250/77f503248501b1b183f121c8b69e83913dd7ecbc.jpg"},{"name":"Assault Artillery","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2857250/17c8051ce6648254e36f9a1964dafc82a7d99194.jpg"},{"name":"Spray N' Pray","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2857250/b85c3c3ff736bb3ec48c08a333bfb80741fb6311.jpg"},{"name":"Sniper Elite","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2857250/2da0dc5c98ace0faf96f5418fd22b3984754cb5c.jpg"},{"name":"Guardian Angel","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2857250/3e960e4efec14df5d8685c88628946766af52f8d.jpg"},{"name":"Impenetrable Defense","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2857250/37c9165e659015067f7cfbfb836d556bedb43244.jpg"},{"name":"Perfectionist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2857250/b3d27a8c0e5a50c463763a923a6894473fdfe515.jpg"},